  unitName: Shock Fist Rahgan
  unitId: 40664
  unitNumber: 1147
  description: An instructor of the Toltya School of Martial Arts. Rahgan made a
    name for himself through his numerous military exploits. However, one day he
    unexpectedly sealed away the power of his own fists. Rumors surfaced stating
    that he did so as self-punishment for practicing forbidden arts, or for having
    hurt a comrade, but the truth remains unknown to this day. Rahgan eventually
    grew old and sickly, which left him in a state of recovery within his school.
    However, when he heard that the God Army was headed towards the dojo during the
    latter part of the war, the seal he had cast over his fists vanished as he warded
    off the enemy.
  summonDesc: I may be a sick old man,<br>but I'll prove myself more useful<br>than
    those useless friends of yours.
  fusionDesc: I've trained countless hours,<br>and yet I still make mistakes.<br>That's
    why I must continue training.
